 "text": "Imagine waking up one morning and your savings are worth less than a cup of coffee. Sounds impossible. In 1923, in Germany, that's exactly what happened. People carried cash in wheelbarrows. A single loaf of bread cost billions of marks. Welcome to financial rise. Here we turn the biggest money stories from the past, the present, and the future into stories you'll actually remember. We'll look at crashes, bubbles, and bold what-if scenarios. No boring charts. No complicated jargon. Just the truth about money and why it matters to you. So what would you do if your money stopped working tomorrow? Stick around. By the end of this video, you might see your wallet a little differently.",
